{"text": "She said that she would dance with me if I brought her red roses, cried the young Student. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But in all my garden there is no red rose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He lay on the grass and cried, and his beautiful eyes filled with tears. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because I have no red rose, my life is sad and empty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From her nest in the oak tree, the Nightingale heard him and wondered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was a small brown bird who sang every night in the garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Here at last is a true lover, said the Nightingale. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Night after night I have sung of him, though I did not know him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now I see him, and his face is as pale as ivory. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Student said that the Prince was giving a ball the next night, and his love would be there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I bring her a red rose, she will dance with me until dawn.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "d", "a", "n", "c", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "m", "e", " ", "i", "f", " ", "I", " ", "b", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "o", "s", "e", "s", ",", " ", "c", "r", "i", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", " ", "S", "t", "u", "d", "e", "n", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "m", "y", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "l", "a", "y", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "a", "s", "s", " ", "a", "